{"_id":"Ps0aStPrJt2kM7nR","name":"Astral Projection","type":"ability","img":"icons/svg/aura.svg","system":{"description":"<p>Roll 1d100 under your Potential to use this ability. On a success, reduce Potential by the amount rolled. On a failure, it works but you gain 1 Stress and all Potential drains until rest. A critical success works better than expected and increases your max Potential by 1d10. A critical failure goes catastrophically wrong and decreases your max Potential by 1d10.</p>","text":"Your mind can wander separate from your body within Long range.","roll":"","psionic":true,"level":1,"level_1":"<p>Your mind can wander separate from your body within Long range.</p>","level_2":"<p>Your projection range increases to Extreme.</p>","level_3":"<p>You project into Hyperspace. Gain 1d5 Stress and ask the Warden one question they answer truthfully.</p>"},"effects":[],"flags":{},"folder":null,"sort":0,"_stats":{"systemId":"mosh","systemVersion":"0.6.13","coreVersion":"13.0","createdTime":1758679200000,"modifiedTime":1758679200000,"lastModifiedBy":""}}
{"_id":"Ps1cLrVsYq4nK8pF","name":"Clairvoyance","type":"ability","img":"icons/svg/aura.svg","system":{"description":"<p>Roll 1d100 under your Potential to use this ability. On a success, reduce Potential by the amount rolled. On a failure, it works but you gain 1 Stress and all Potential drains until rest. A critical success works better than expected and increases your max Potential by 1d10. A critical failure goes catastrophically wrong and decreases your max Potential by 1d10.</p>","text":"Roll 1d100 and note the result, which you may use in place of a future roll.","roll":"","psionic":true,"level":1,"level_1":"<p>Roll 1d100 and note the result, which you may use in place of a future roll.</p>","level_2":"<p>You may use your pre-rolled result for another character.</p>","level_3":"<p>You may transpose the numbers of your pre-rolled result when rolled.</p>"},"effects":[],"flags":{},"folder":null,"sort":0,"_stats":{"systemId":"mosh","systemVersion":"0.6.13","coreVersion":"13.0","createdTime":1758679200000,"modifiedTime":1758679200000,"lastModifiedBy":""}}
{"_id":"Ps2eHlGwXb6rJ3mT","name":"Energy Healing","type":"ability","img":"icons/svg/aura.svg","system":{"description":"<p>Roll 1d100 under your Potential to use this ability. On a success, reduce Potential by the amount rolled. On a failure, it works but you gain 1 Stress and all Potential drains until rest. A critical success works better than expected and increases your max Potential by 1d10. A critical failure goes catastrophically wrong and decreases your max Potential by 1d10.</p>","text":"You can heal 1d10 HP or 1 Stress.","roll":"","psionic":true,"level":1,"level_1":"<p>You can heal 1d10 HP or 1 Stress.</p>","level_2":"<p>You heal 1d10 HP and 1 Stress.</p>","level_3":"<p>You heal to max HP and 1d5 Stress.</p>"},"effects":[],"flags":{},"folder":null,"sort":0,"_stats":{"systemId":"mosh","systemVersion":"0.6.13","coreVersion":"13.0","createdTime":1758679200000,"modifiedTime":1758679200000,"lastModifiedBy":""}}
{"_id":"Ps3iLsQdZf8tN5kV","name":"Illusions","type":"ability","img":"icons/svg/aura.svg","system":{"description":"<p>Roll 1d100 under your Potential to use this ability. On a success, reduce Potential by the amount rolled. On a failure, it works but you gain 1 Stress and all Potential drains until rest. A critical success works better than expected and increases your max Potential by 1d10. A critical failure goes catastrophically wrong and decreases your max Potential by 1d10.</p>","text":"You conjure an illusion in the minds of people within Close range. Does not work on Androids.","roll":"","psionic":true,"level":1,"level_1":"<p>You conjure an illusion in the minds of people within Close range. Does not work on Androids.</p>","level_2":"<p>You can project up to Long range.</p>","level_3":"<p>The minds of those seeing your illusions treat them as real, and are physically affected by them.</p>"},"effects":[],"flags":{},"folder":null,"sort":0,"_stats":{"systemId":"mosh","systemVersion":"0.6.13","coreVersion":"13.0","createdTime":1758679200000,"modifiedTime":1758679200000,"lastModifiedBy":""}}
{"_id":"Ps4mMcRuWg1xP9jB","name":"Mind Control","type":"ability","img":"icons/svg/aura.svg","system":{"description":"<p>Roll 1d100 under your Potential to use this ability. On a success, reduce Potential by the amount rolled. On a failure, it works but you gain 1 Stress and all Potential drains until rest. A critical success works better than expected and increases your max Potential by 1d10. A critical failure goes catastrophically wrong and decreases your max Potential by 1d10.</p>","text":"Manipulate the mind of another person you are in physical contact with, bending them to your will.","roll":"","psionic":true,"level":1,"level_1":"<p>Manipulate the mind of another person you are in physical contact with, bending them to your will.</p>","level_2":"<p>You control one person within Close range. If they suffer harm the connection breaks.</p>","level_3":"<p>You control up to 1d5+1 people in Close range. (Roll each time)</p>"},"effects":[],"flags":{},"folder":null,"sort":0,"_stats":{"systemId":"mosh","systemVersion":"0.6.13","coreVersion":"13.0","createdTime":1758679200000,"modifiedTime":1758679200000,"lastModifiedBy":""}}
{"_id":"Ps5nPhSkYh3zQ7cD","name":"Photokinesis","type":"ability","img":"icons/svg/aura.svg","system":{"description":"<p>Roll 1d100 under your Potential to use this ability. On a success, reduce Potential by the amount rolled. On a failure, it works but you gain 1 Stress and all Potential drains until rest. A critical success works better than expected and increases your max Potential by 1d10. A critical failure goes catastrophically wrong and decreases your max Potential by 1d10.</p>","text":"You bend light, shaping pools of light and shadow in Close range.","roll":"","psionic":true,"level":1,"level_1":"<p>You bend light, shaping pools of light and shadow in Close range.</p>","level_2":"<p>You render invisibility to a person or object in Close range, including yourself.</p>","level_3":"<p>You focus existing light into a weapon, blinding those with eyes and dealing 1d10 DMG.</p>"},"effects":[],"flags":{},"folder":null,"sort":0,"_stats":{"systemId":"mosh","systemVersion":"0.6.13","coreVersion":"13.0","createdTime":1758679200000,"modifiedTime":1758679200000,"lastModifiedBy":""}}
{"_id":"Ps6pTkUvBj5aR4eG","name":"Pyrokinesis","type":"ability","img":"icons/svg/aura.svg","system":{"description":"<p>Roll 1d100 under your Potential to use this ability. On a success, reduce Potential by the amount rolled. On a failure, it works but you gain 1 Stress and all Potential drains until rest. A critical success works better than expected and increases your max Potential by 1d10. A critical failure goes catastrophically wrong and decreases your max Potential by 1d10.</p>","text":"You start fires with your mind within Close range. This deals Burning +1 (as Bleeding).","roll":"","psionic":true,"level":1,"level_1":"<p>You start fires with your mind within Close range. This deals Burning +1 (as Bleeding).</p>","level_2":"<p>You can increase range to Long or deal Burning +2.</p>","level_3":"<p>You may invert your power, freezing instead of burning.</p>"},"effects":[],"flags":{},"folder":null,"sort":0,"_stats":{"systemId":"mosh","systemVersion":"0.6.13","coreVersion":"13.0","createdTime":1758679200000,"modifiedTime":1758679200000,"lastModifiedBy":""}}
{"_id":"Ps7qWmVwCl7bS2fH","name":"Telekinesis","type":"ability","img":"icons/svg/aura.svg","system":{"description":"<p>Roll 1d100 under your Potential to use this ability. On a success, reduce Potential by the amount rolled. On a failure, it works but you gain 1 Stress and all Potential drains until rest. A critical success works better than expected and increases your max Potential by 1d10. A critical failure goes catastrophically wrong and decreases your max Potential by 1d10.</p>","text":"You move an object within Close distance with your mind. It can be no heavier than what you can physically carry.","roll":"","psionic":true,"level":1,"level_1":"<p>You move an object within Close distance with your mind. It can be no heavier than what you can physically carry.</p>","level_2":"<p>You move an object within Long range. It can be up to twice as heavy as what you can carry.</p>","level_3":"<p>You move a heavy object (up to 5x what you can carry) or 1d5 separate objects within Long range.</p>"},"effects":[],"flags":{},"folder":null,"sort":0,"_stats":{"systemId":"mosh","systemVersion":"0.6.13","coreVersion":"13.0","createdTime":1758679200000,"modifiedTime":1758679200000,"lastModifiedBy":""}}
{"_id":"Ps8rXnWxDm9cT6gI","name":"Telepathy","type":"ability","img":"icons/svg/aura.svg","system":{"description":"<p>Roll 1d100 under your Potential to use this ability. On a success, reduce Potential by the amount rolled. On a failure, it works but you gain 1 Stress and all Potential drains until rest. A critical success works better than expected and increases your max Potential by 1d10. A critical failure goes catastrophically wrong and decreases your max Potential by 1d10.</p>","text":"You read surface level thoughts and communicate without speaking in Adjacent range.","roll":"","psionic":true,"level":1,"level_1":"<p>You read surface level thoughts and communicate without speaking in Adjacent range.</p>","level_2":"<p>You read deeper thoughts at Adjacent range OR read surface thoughts in Close range.</p>","level_3":"<p>You read deeper thoughts at Long range or up to 1d5 different people at Close range.</p>"},"effects":[],"flags":{},"folder":null,"sort":0,"_stats":{"systemId":"mosh","systemVersion":"0.6.13","coreVersion":"13.0","createdTime":1758679200000,"modifiedTime":1758679200000,"lastModifiedBy":""}}
{"_id":"Ps9sYoXyEn2dU8hJ","name":"Teleportation","type":"ability","img":"icons/svg/aura.svg","system":{"description":"<p>Roll 1d100 under your Potential to use this ability. On a success, reduce Potential by the amount rolled. On a failure, it works but you gain 1 Stress and all Potential drains until rest. A critical success works better than expected and increases your max Potential by 1d10. A critical failure goes catastrophically wrong and decreases your max Potential by 1d10.</p>","text":"You teleport yourself within Long range. If teleporting to a point you can't see, there is a 50% chance you teleport yourself into a wall or other danger.","roll":"","psionic":true,"level":1,"level_1":"<p>You teleport yourself within Long range. If teleporting to a point you can't see, there is a 50% chance you teleport yourself into a wall or other danger.</p>","level_2":"<p>You can teleport yourself or another person or object.</p>","level_3":"<p>You can teleport both yourself and one other person or object within Long range.</p>"},"effects":[],"flags":{},"folder":null,"sort":0,"_stats":{"systemId":"mosh","systemVersion":"0.6.13","coreVersion":"13.0","createdTime":1758679200000,"modifiedTime":1758679200000,"lastModifiedBy":""}}
